# Keep every text file with LF line endings on every computer. The blog checks some files byte for byte:
# database updates (src/migrations), the editor bundle (assets/vendor, against toastui-editor.sha256), and shell scripts run on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.stl binary
